  "name": "Question 6",
  "problem": "Let $F=GH.$ What is the value of ${f}_{12}$, if\n\n$$\nG=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 6 \\\\ 1 & -3\\end{aligned}],\\,H=[\\begin{aligned}4 & -5 \\\\ 2 & 7\\end{aligned}]?\n$$\n\n${f}_{12}=$\n{{field-1}}",
